    "Mutate: Replaces Base Affixes with random Aember Base Affixes and sets the gear to Corroded.",
    "Chaos: Re-rolls the values of all affixes without changing affix tiers and sets the gear to Corroded.",
    "Arrogant: Upgrades 1 pre-fixe/suffix by 1 - 2 tiers and sets the gear to Corroded.",
    "Void: Sets the gear to Corroded.",
    "The following Corrosion effects could appear if the Corrosion is Darkest Corrosion:",
    "Desecration: Upgrades 2 pre-fixes/suffixes by 1 - 2 tiers and sets the gear to Corroded.",
    "Vorax Corrosion can be performed on Vorax Gear.",
    "Each Corrosion grants the Corroded Vorax Gear one of the following effects:",
    "Hyperplastic: Upgrades 1 random affix by 1 - 2 tiers and sets the gear to Corroded.",
    "Limb-Stitched: Upgrades 2 random affixes by 1 - 2 tiers and sets the gear to Corroded.",
    "Metamorphosized: Upgrades all pre-fixes by 1 - 2 tiers and sets the gear to Corroded.",
    "Derived: Upgrades all suffixes by 1 - 2 tiers and sets the gear to Corroded.",
    "Festered: Sets the gear to Corroded and binds the gear.",
